# === Project-Specific ===

# Adapter/standard executable output
anvil-adapter-flutter
anvil-adapter-flutter.exe
anvil-adapter-*
# Note: the executable SOURCE lives at cmd/flutter-adapter/ and is tracked;
# only built binaries named anvil-adapter-* are ignored (the directory
# pattern *-adapter would hide the source directory, so it is not used).
